      <slug></slug>
      <title>Debian Secrets: power tools for power users</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Distributions</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will highlight some Debian-specific tools, explain what they do, and how they are useful for both Debian packagers and users.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We hope to compare these tools against similar tools in other distributions.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;It is a reworked version of a talk that has been done at DebConf8, where the target audience were power users.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="471">Wouter Verhelst</person>
      </persons>
